WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:18.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; MR. ABBETON.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
MR. EBERLE.
CHOOSE YOUR WEAPONS.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.090
&gt;&gt; OH, KIND SIRS.
MY AFFECTIONS ARE NOT WORTH THIS

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
QUARREL.
WHATEVER INJURY YOU ANY MIGHT

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.596
INCUR CANNOT COMPETE WITH THE
WOUND YOU INFLICT UPON MY HEART.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:32.432
&gt;&gt; LISTEN TO HER GENTLEMAN.
NO WOMAN IS WORTH LOSING LIFE

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:37.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND LIMB OVER.
&gt;&gt; THIS MAN HAS LAID CLAIM TO

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHAT IS RIGHTFULLY MINE.
AND I WILL HAVE SATISFACTION.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.573
&gt;&gt; I WILL NOT REST UNTIL HIS
BLOOD IS SPILLED UPON THIS VERY

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
CROWN.
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT BEAR TO SEE EITHER

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.545
OF YOU SUFFER EVEN THE SLIGHTEST
OF WOUNDS.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:49.282
&gt;&gt; THEN I SUGGEST YOU LOOK AWAY.
&gt;&gt; DO AS HE SAYS, MY LADY.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:52.052
&gt;&gt; YOU AGREED UPON THE TERMS.
TEN PACES AND THEN TURN AND

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:55.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
FIRE.
MR. ABBETON.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; READY.
&gt;&gt; MR. EBERLE.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:01:00.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BAM!
&gt;&gt; OH, ARE YOU OKAY?

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:05.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD, SORRY.
&gt;&gt; I THINK HE GOT A LITTLE BIT

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
SHOT.
&gt;&gt; THE ONLY PAIN I FEEL IS

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
SEEING THE TWO MEN I ADORE AT
ODDS.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:13.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU'RE DEFINITELY
BLEEDING.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOTHING COMPARED TO
THEIR SUFFERING.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.508
&gt;&gt; GENTLEMEN, I THINK WE SHOULD
GO OVER THE RULES BEGIN.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
BECAUSE HE WENT EARLY, RIGHT?

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:22.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
SO, JUST TO BE CLEAR, YOU WILL

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.049
WALK TEN PACES AND THEN TURN AND
SHOOT.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
UNDERSTOOD?
&gt;&gt; AND WHAT DO I DO?

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE SAME THING.
&gt;&gt; AS BEFORE?

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:29.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
OKAY.
BANG!

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:33.960
&gt;&gt; 'TIS BUT A PIN PRICK.
THE ONLY PAIN IS LOVING A WOMAN

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.128 size:84% position:42%
THAT ANOTHER MAN LOVES.
&gt;&gt; I'M SORRY, MY LADY.

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.529
I'M NOT VERY GOOD AT THIS GAME.
&gt;&gt; DO NOT GIVE ME A SECOND

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
THOUGHT.
I BESEECH YOU, SIR.

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:43.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
THINK ONLY OF YOURSELF.
&gt;&gt; OKAY, PERHAPS WE SHOULD

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:44.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
ABANDON THE GUNS AND TAKE OFF
OUR CLOTHES AND FIGHT.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OUR CLOTHES.
WHY ARE YOU INVOLVED?

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.308
&gt;&gt; WELL, I'M MAD TOO.
THIS IS TAKING UP MY WHOLE DAMN

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
DAY.
&gt;&gt; LET'S TRY ONE MORE TIME.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.579
&gt;&gt; I'M JUST GOING TO MOVE YOU
HERE RIGHT IN FRONT OF HER.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:57.150
&gt;&gt; SO, THAT WAY I CAN SEE.
&gt;&gt; GENTLEMEN, I'M GOING TO WALK

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU THROUGH THIS.
DO EXACTLY AS I SAY.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
TAKE ONE STEP --
&gt;&gt; ONE STEP?

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.720
I THOUGHT WE WERE GOING TO TAKE
TEN.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ARE WE AT TEN ALREADY?
BANG.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO, I HAVEN'T GOTTEN TO GO
BANG ONCE!

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:09.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
BANG.
&gt;&gt; CURRENTLY THERE ARE TWO

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:14.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
BULLETS AND THEY ARE BOUNCING
AROUND THE COURTYARD.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.236
I'M SURE I CAN JUST PEEK OUT TO
SEE WHAT'S HANNING.

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
HAPPENING.
&gt;&gt; OH, MY LORD.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
I HATE THIS DAY.
&gt;&gt; THE TWO OF YOU SHOULD BE

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
ASHAMED!
HAND ME THAT PISTOL.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DO BE CAREFUL.
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
OH!
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD.

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:30.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
GIVE THAT BACK.
&gt;&gt; WHY DID YOU DO THAT?

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M SORRY, I WAS TRYING
SOMETHING.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:41.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THIS ENDS NOW!
&gt;&gt; MY LADY, YOUR LEGS!

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MR. EBERLE.
MR. ABBETON.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:49.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
I HAVE SOMETHING TO SAY AND I
WILL BE HEARD!

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:52.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU HAVE SUFFERED ENOUGH.
&gt;&gt; SHE'S RIGHT.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
DO YOU FORGIVE ME?
&gt;&gt; I DO.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:02.615
&gt;&gt; NOW GIVE ME THOSE WEAPONS AND
LET THE HEALING BEGIN.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:06.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH!
&gt;&gt; YEP, THAT'S A HAIR TRIGGER

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:09.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
RIGHT THERE.

